# 统一行尾。见 https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes
#
# 默认:仓库内保存 LF,检出时按平台决定。
# 不做这一步的话,Windows 上 `core.autocrlf=true` 会让 git 反复
# 报告 "LF will be replaced by CRLF",每次 diff 都有一堆噪音。

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF,否则某些解析器会出错
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# PowerShell 脚本保持 LF(已验证在 Windows PowerShell 5.1 下正常)
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要动
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.exe binary
*.bin binary
*.onnx binary
